            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chelsea Koziatek"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was not my first time frying but my first time frying Oreos. This ratio wasn't thick enough to coat, so I needed to add about 3/4C more pancake mix. I used Bisquick Original.",
            "datePublished": "2020-03-10T20:57:47.493Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "John Gordon Jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family likes this recipe, minus the cayenne and hot sauce, but I also add dill and onion powder to the dry batter and use finely ground corn meal and a bit of baking powder. You can also make it a wet batter and add Sprite, to puff them up a little. I then make homemade Ranch and add some cayenne and hot sauce to some of that, for those who like a little heat.",
            "datePublished": "2019-10-12T20:25:00.373Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
